#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:172
msgid "Terms of Use link"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:175
msgid ""
"This field sets the URL for the Terms of Use of a self-hosted site. A "
"link to the terms appears at the bottom of the sign-up and login pages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:177
msgid ""
"The default URL links to a `Terms of Use <https://mattermost.com/terms-"
"of-use/>`__ page hosted on ``mattermost.com``. This includes the "
"Mattermost Acceptable Use Policy explaining the terms under which "
"Mattermost software is provided to end users. If you change the default "
"link to add your own terms, the new terms **must include a link** to the "
"default terms so end users are aware of the Mattermost Acceptable Use "
"Policy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:179
msgid "String input. Default is ``https://about.mattermost.com/default-terms/``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:176
