"Specify the default configuration of system messages displayed when users"
" join or leave channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:851
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Join/Leave messages are displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:852
msgid "**false**: Join/Leave messages are hidden."
msgstr ""

