#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1138
msgid "Enable email notifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1141
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Enables automatic email notifications for posts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1142
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables notifications. A developer may choose this option to "
"speed development by skipping email setup (see also the **Enable preview "
"mode banner** setting)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1142
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``SendEmailNotifications`` >"
" ``ture``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1143
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_SENDEMAILNOTIFICATIONS``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1148
msgid ""
"If this setting is **false**, and the SMTP server is set up, account-"
"related emails (such as authentication messages) will be sent regardless "
"of this setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1149
msgid ""
"Email invitations and account deactivation emails aren't affected by this"
" setting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1150
msgid ""
"If you don't plan on :doc:`configuring Mattermost for email "
"</administration-guide/configure/smtp-email>`, disabling this "
"configuration setting in larger deployments may improve server "
"performance in the following areas, particularly in high-traffic "
"environments where performance is a key concern:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1152
msgid ""
"**Reduced Server Load**: Generating and sending emails requires "
"processing power and resources. By disabling email notifications, you "
"reduce the load on the server, which can be reallocated to other tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1153
msgid ""
"**Decreased I/O Operations**: Sending emails involves input/output (I/O) "
"operations, such as writing to logs and databases, and handling "
"communication with the email server. Reducing these I/O operations can "
"improve overall system efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1154
msgid ""
"**Lowered Network Traffic**: Each email sent contributes to network "
"traffic. Disabling email notifications decreases the amount of data being"
" transmitted, which can lead to better performance, especially in "
"environments with limited bandwidth."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1155
msgid ""
"**Faster Response Times**: With fewer background tasks (like sending "
"emails) to handle, the application can potentially respond to user "
"requests more quickly, improving perceived performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1156
msgid ""
"**Resource Allocation**: Resources like CPU cycles, memory, and network "
"bandwidth that would have been used for sending emails can be used "
"elsewhere, possibly improving the performance of other critical "
"components of the system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1157
msgid ""
"However, disabling email notifications can negatively impact user "
"experience, communication efficiency, and overall productivity. It's "
"important to balance performance improvements with the needs of your "
"organization and users."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1172
msgid "Enable preview mode banner"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1175
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** When **Send email notifications** is **false**, "
"users see the Preview Mode banner. This banner alerts users that email "
"notifications are disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1176
