"``config.json`` setting: ``EmailSettings`` > ``EnableEmailBatching`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1199
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_EMAILSETTINGS_ENABLEEMAILBATCHING``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1207
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Site Url <administration-guide/configure/environment-"
"configuration-settings:site url>` and :ref:`SMTP Email Server "
"<administration-guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:smtp "
"server>` must be configured to allow email batching."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1208
msgid ""
"Regardless of how this setting is configured, users can :ref:`disable "
"email-based notifications altogether <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-"
"your-notifications:email notifications>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1209
msgid ""
"When email batching is enabled, users can :ref:`customize how often to "
"receive batched notifications <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-"
"notifications:email notifications>`. The default frequency is 15 minutes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1210
msgid ""
"Email batching in :ref:`High Availability Mode <administration-"
"guide/configure/environment-configuration-settings:enable high "
"availability mode>` is planned, but not yet supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1223
