#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1720
msgid "Enable burn-on-read messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/_static/badges/entry-adv.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry and Enterprise Advanced "
"<https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__ plans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1725
msgid ""
":ref:`Burn-on-read messages <end-user-guide/collaborate/send-"
"messages:send burn-on-read messages>` have irreversible behavior:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1727
msgid "Once a recipient reveals a burn-on-read message, it can't be hidden again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1728
msgid ""
"Once a burn-on-read message expires or is burned, it is permanently "
"deleted and can't be recovered."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1729
msgid "Recipients can't reply to, edit, or thread burn-on-read messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1732
msgid "Enable or disable burn-on-read messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1734
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** The option to send a burn-on-read message isn't "
"available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1735
msgid ""
"**true**: Users can send burn-on-read messages in channels, direct "
"messages, and group messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1733
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > ``EnableBurnOnRead`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1734
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLEBURNONREAD``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1739
msgid ""
"Disabling this feature prevents users from sending new burn-on-read "
"messages. Once disabled, users can interact with existing burn-on-read "
"messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1749
msgid "Burn-on-read duration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1755
msgid ""
"Sets the countdown duration for burn-on-read messages once they are "
"revealed. After a recipient reveals a burn-on-read message, the message "
"is deleted for that user after the specified duration. This setting "
"applies to all burn-on-read messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1758
msgid "Numerical input in seconds. Default is **600** seconds (10 minutes)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1756
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``BurnOnReadDurationSeconds`` > ``600``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1757
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_BURNONREADDURATIONSECONDS``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1769
msgid "Maximum time to live for burn-on-read messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1775
msgid ""
"Sets the maximum duration that burn-on-read messages can exist after they"
" are sent. The message is deleted after the specified duration, even if "
"it hasn't been revealed by all recipients."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1778
msgid "Numerical input in seconds. Default is **604800** seconds (7 days)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1776
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings`` > "
"``BurnOnReadMaximumTimeToLiveSeconds`` > ``604800``"
