#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1877
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLESVGS``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1881
msgid ""
"Enabling SVGs is not recommended in environments where not all users are "
"trusted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1894
msgid "Enable LaTeX code block rendering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:1897
msgid ""
"**true**: Enables rendering of :ref:`LaTeX in code blocks <end-user-"
