"``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2278
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_ENABLEMOBILEUPLOAD``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2292
msgid "Allow file downloads on mobile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2295
msgid "**true**: **(Default)** Enables file downloads on mobile apps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2296
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables file downloads on mobile apps. Users can still "
"download files from a mobile web browser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2295
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2319
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2344
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > File sharing and downloads**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2296
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``EnableMobileDownload`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2297
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_ENABLEMOBILEDOWNLOAD``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2311
msgid "Enable secure file preview on mobile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2316
msgid ""
"This setting improves an organization's mobile security posture by "
"restricting file access while still allowing essential file viewing "
"capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2319
msgid ""
"**true**: Prevents file downloads, previews, and sharing for most file "
"types, even when the :ref:`Allow file downloads on mobile "
"<administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:allow file "
"downloads on mobile>` configuration setting is enabled. Allows in-app "
"previews for PDFs, videos, and images only. Files are stored temporarily "
"in the app's cache and cannot be exported or shared."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2324
msgid "**false**: **(Default)** Secure file preview mode is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2320
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``MobileEnableSecureFilePreview`` > ``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2321
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MOBILEENABLESECUREFILEPREVIEW``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2338
msgid "Allow PDF link navigation on mobile"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2344
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Enables tapping links inside PDFs when Secure "
"File Preview Mode is active. Links will open in the device browser or "
"supported app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2347
msgid ""
"**false**: Disables link navigation in PDFs when Secure File Preview Mode"
" is active."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2345
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > "
"``MobileAllowPdfLinkNavigation`` > ``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2346
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_MOBILEALLOWPDFLINKNAVIGATION``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2353
msgid ""
"This setting has no effect when the :ref:`Secure file preview on mobile "
"<administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings:enable secure"
" file preview on mobile>` configuration setting is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2358
msgid "Public Links"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2360
msgid ""
"With self-hosted deployments, you can access the following configuration "
"settings in the System Console by going to **Site Configuration > Public "
"Links**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2373
msgid "Enable public file links"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2376
msgid ""
"**true**: Allows users to create :doc:`public links </end-user-"
"guide/collaborate/share-files-in-messages>` to files attached to "
"Mattermost messages."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2377
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Prevents users from creating public links to "
"files and disables all previously created links."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2376
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2395
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Public Links**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2377
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``EnablePublicLink`` > "
"``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2378
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_ENABLEPUBLICLINK``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2382
msgid ""
"When set to **false**, anyone who tries to visit a previously created "
"public link will receive an error message. If the setting is returned to "
"**true**, previously created links will be accessible, unless the "
"**Public link salt** has been regenerated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2392
msgid "Public link salt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2395
msgid ""
"32-character salt added to the URL of public file links. Changing this "
"setting will **invalidate** all previously generated links. The salt is "
"randomly generated when Mattermost is installed, and can be regenerated "
"by selecting **Regenerate** in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2396
msgid "``config.json`` setting: ``FileSettings`` > ``PublicLinkSalt``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2397
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_FILESETTINGS_PUBLICLINKSALT``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2403
msgid "Notices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2405
msgid ""
"Access the following configuration settings in the System Console by "
"going to **Site Configuration > Notices**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2418
msgid "Enable admin notices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2421
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** System admins will receive :doc:`in-product "
"notices </administration-guide/manage/in-product-notices>` about server "
"upgrades and administration features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2423
msgid ""
"**false**: System admins will not receive specific notices. Admins will "
"still receive notices for all users (see **Enable end user notices**)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2421
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Notices** -"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2422
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AnnouncementSettings`` > "
"``AdminNoticesEnabled`` > ``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2423
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ANNOUNCEMENTSETTINGS_ADMINNOTICESENABLED``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2437
msgid "Enable end user notices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2440
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** All users receive :doc:`in-product notices "
"</administration-guide/manage/in-product-notices>` about client upgrades "
"and end user features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2441
msgid "**false**: Users will not receive in-product notices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2440
msgid "System Config path: **Site Configuration > Notices**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2441
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``AnnouncementSettings`` > "
"``UserNoticesEnabled`` > ``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2442
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_ANNOUNCEMENTSETTINGS_USERNOTICESENABLED``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2446
msgid "Connected workspaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2451
msgid ""
"The following settings aren't available in the System Console and can "
"only be set in ``config.json``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2453
msgid ""
"When connected workspaces are enabled, system admins can :doc:`create and"
" manage connected workspaces </administration-guide/onboard/connected-"
"workspaces>` in the System Console by going to **Site Configuration > "
"Connected Workspaces**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2463
msgid "Enable connected workspaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2465
msgid ""
"Enable the ability to establish secure connections between Mattermost "
"instances, and invite secured connections to shared channels where users "
"can participate as they would in any public and private channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2467
msgid ""
"Connected workspaces requires Mattermost Enterprise servers running v10.2"
" or later."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2469
msgid ""
"By default, both configuration settings are disabled and must be enabled "
"in order to share channels with secure connections. Enabling connected "
"workspace functionality requires a server restart."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2471
msgid "This feature's two ``config.json`` settings include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2473
msgid ""
"``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings.EnableRemoteClusterService: false`` with "
"options ``true`` and ``false``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2474
msgid ""
"``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings.EnableSharedChannels: false`` with options "
"``true`` and ``false``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2478
msgid ""
"Neither setting is available in the System Console and can only be set in"
" ``config.json`` under ``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2479
msgid ""
"System admins for Cloud deployments can submit a request to have these "
"required configuration settings enabled for their Cloud deployment "
"instance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2480
msgid ""
"Following an upgrade to Mattermost v10.2 or later, existing configuration"
" values for shared channels, including ``EnableSharedChannels`` and "
"``EnableRemoteClusterService`` are automatically converted to connected "
"workspace configuration settings in the ``config.json`` file. The "
":ref:`deprecated shared channels experimental settings <administration-"
"guide/configure/deprecated-configuration-settings:shared channels "
"settings>` remain in the ``config.json`` file to support backwards "
"compatibility."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2493
msgid "Disable shared channel status sync"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2495
msgid ""
"Disable member status and availability synchronization between connected "
"workspaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2498
msgid ""
"**true**: Channel as well as member status and availability isn't "
"synchronized."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2499
msgid ""
"**false**: **(Default)** Channel as well as channel member status and "
"availability is synchronized at regular intervals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2499
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings`` > "
"``DisableSharedChannelsStatusSync`` > ``false``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2505
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2546
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2567
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2588
msgid ""
"Enabling these features can increase the load on your Mattermost server’s"
" CPU, memory, and database due to frequent updates, database queries, and"
" API communication. Excessive sync frequency and retries can overwhelm "
"system resources, potentially causing performance degradation or "
"instability. Monitor your system carefully when enabling these features."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2515
msgid "Default maximum posts per sync"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2518
msgid "Define the default maximum number of mesages to synchronize at a time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2520
msgid "Default is **50**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2519
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings`` > "
"``DefaultMaxPostsPerSync`` > ``50``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2534
msgid "Sync users on connection open"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2536
msgid ""
"Automatically synchronize users when a new connection between workspaces "
"is established. This ensures that remote users are immediately "
"discoverable for direct and group messages without requiring them to post"
" in a shared channel first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2539
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Users are automatically synchronized when a new "
"connection is established."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2540
msgid ""
"**false**: Users are not automatically synchronized when a new connection"
" is established."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2540
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings`` > "
"``SyncUsersOnConnectionOpen`` > ``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2556
msgid "Global user sync batch size"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2559
msgid ""
"The number of users to sync in each batch when performing global user "
"synchronization between connected workspaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2562
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2583
msgid "Default is **100**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2560
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings`` > "
"``GlobalUserSyncBatchSize`` > ``100``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2577
msgid "Member sync batch size"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2580
msgid ""
"The number of channel members to sync in each batch when synchronizing "
"channel membership between connected workspaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2581
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ConnectedWorkspacesSettings`` > "
"``MemberSyncBatchSize`` > ``100``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2593
msgid "config.json-only settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2595
msgid ""
"The following self-hosted deployment settings are only configurable in "
"the ``config.json`` file and are not available in the System Console."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2605
msgid "Cross-team search"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2608
msgid "Disable the ability to search across all teams or a specific team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2611
msgid ""
"**true**: **(Default)** Cross-team search is enabled. Searches can be "
"performed against all channels the user is a member of across all teams, "
"a specific team, or the current team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2615
msgid ""
"**false**: Cross-team search is disabled. Searches are performed on all "
"channels the user is member of within the current team only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2609
msgid ""
"``config.json`` setting: ``ServiceSettings.EnableCrossTeamSearch`` > "
"``true``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-settings.rst:2610
msgid "Environment variable: ``MM_SERVICESETTINGS_ENABLECROSSTEAMSEARCH``"
msgstr ""

